8510 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(ClearTax processes over one billion e-invoices a year for 5,000-plus enterprise clients \024 the scale that proves the infrastructure holds under real-time clearance, high volume, and simultaneous multi-country deployments. Rejections trigger automated retry and escalation under contractually committed SLAs. Uptime SLA is 99.9%, hosted on AWS, OCI, or GCP with local-region deployment per jurisdiction.)/K[4]/P 8511 0 R/Pg 7430 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj

