endobj

8514 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(The regulatory update SLA is day-zero or within 48 hours of a government change, deployed by an in-house team of 100-plus tax experts, not engineers trained on a product. You are notified; you do not build the fix. IRP designation in India, ZATCA accreditation in Saudi Arabia, and PA listing in France are the government relationships behind that cadence.)/K[6]/P 8515 0 R/Pg 7430 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj

8515 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/K[8514 0 R]/P 8544 0 R/S/P/Pg 7430 0 R>>
endobj

