<</Type/StructElem/K[8520 0 R]/P 8544 0 R/S/P/Pg 7430 0 R>>
endobj

8522 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(Local teams in key jurisdictions, not offshore-only. When a clearance rejection cascades at midnight, escalation goes straight to engineering under defined resolution SLAs, with no pooled queue between your business and the fix. The 100-plus in-house tax experts advise on compliance positioning, not just platform operation.)/K[10]/P 8523 0 R/Pg 7430 0 R/S/Span>>
endobj

